        <text name="rf_pda_side_info_dairy" text="[EN] This pause page is your barn herd glance. Each row is one dairy barn: herd score, the milk sale quality you would get today, and spoilage stage since the last collection. Sale quality already includes spoilage: if milk is ageing, the tier you see is the pulled-down one, not a separate earned grade. Warnings for feed disease or mycotoxin appear only when the barn data already carries them. Esc does not schedule collections, change contracts, or set feed fields. Open Farm Tablet Dairy when you have it for the deep desk. Quiet when Precision Farming is active." />
